  "description": "Escape The Lab - A fast-paced AI-powered puzzle game where you have 10 minutes to solve 20 challenging questions. Features: Multiple AI providers (OpenAI GPT-4o, Claude Sonnet, Gemini, DeepSeek) | User authentication with online leaderboards | Database-driven event prompts for seasonal games | Auto-save/resume | Power-ups (Speed Boost, Micro Hint) | Real-time streaming responses | Cloud prompt support | Question types: IQ puzzles, logic challenges, coding problems, and mysteries. Play solo or compete globally!",
